            </note>
            <note corresp="#d317-f2" n="3" xml:id="d317-f2-content">
                <p>Presumably the reference here is to the message mentioned in the memorandum by
                    the Combined Chiefs of Staff, August 18, the text of which is given in the annex
                    to that memorandum, <ref target="#pg542">p. 542</ref>.</p>
            </note>
